      "order": 3,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "top",
      "body": "One row per candidate, ordered by a score. The rank sits in a medal (gold, silver and bronze for the first three), the gene is bold, the protein change monospace, the model and impact are badges and the score is a bar. Hover a row for the fields behind it. Click a row to pin its popover and pick the variant: the table below narrows to it, and the Family section draws the case with the proband marked and each member filled by genotype (solid homozygous alternate, half heterozygous, open reference, grey no call). Input: the ranked variants of nf-core/raredisease.\n",
